  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Wu Yong enters the cardinal directional wind formation at Corpse Emperor Yu Ding Tian after luring the Fierce Gorge Seven Ghosts into a trap. When they charge him, strong winds appear and frosty air blows. Winds roar and snow pours down like a blizzard. Three of the seven ghosts freeze solid. After two breaths of time, two of them die from the cold. The remaining ghosts ask what killer move this is and cry that it is so cold. Their formation falls into chaos. Wu Yong follows it with Willow Wind.",
